Read loose text files the way Windows does

A text file is opened in text mode, which on Windows turns each CR LF into
LF as it is read. Inside the game's archives the engine does that itself;
for a loose file in the data folder it relies on the C library, which on
every other system leaves the CR in place. Lists read line by line then
name files with a CR at the end that are never found. Mods made on Windows
ship their lists with CR LF: Fallout Fixt's, for one (upstream issue #130).
